 "details": {
  "title": "Pretend You Don’t See Her, on the Fret Finder guitar",
  "lead": "The singer’s line, read by machine from the record’s separated voice and set on the bars of the Fret Finder page, which brings the song down to E minor, then F minor for the last verse; an octave up for the trumpet, concert B3 to E-flat 5. The time is his, slow and free. This one has not been checked by ear note for note: where a note looks wrong against the words, trust the record.",
